  "body": "Add the HDBLAST exterior tensor-derivative checkpoint to its shared project page. At one point before shell contact, the actual total registered tensor coefficient and its first/second coordinate derivatives are enclosed; the value and scaled time derivative are negative, while all three second-derivative signs remain inconclusive.\n\nThe addition links the verified source and derivation with explicit model/gauge/observable limits. Removing the exact inserted block recovers the complete previous page byte for byte. All other projects and files remain unchanged. No new Zenodo version or journal submission accompanies this checkpoint.\n",
